{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded at the shore of mystic woods you will join the troops of slimes to defeat hordes of enemies threatening the kingdom of Holy Slime. But no worries, you won't fight those battles alone. Your cute, little, yet combat ready companion will help you with your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect  fruits on your journey to transform your companion and make it even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br>Play together on a single keyboard or with gamepad controllers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player 2 will take over the control of Slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survivors-like action in short 10 minute sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 wearables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 artifacts that last through rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slime companion that can be transformed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lightweight RPG World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalistic Dialogues</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561970?t=1742413565","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/aca92ceab45962c6b19ca35d15e3e99cb0e70634/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742413565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/91a2b8d1b937274bfad2c817366ab3adea06adc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742413565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561970/91a2b8d1b937274bfad2c817366ab3adea06adc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742413565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/S